  "body": "Imagine coming home to a little slice of Florida, right here in family-friendly Glendowie.\r\n\r\nAfter several months of extensive upgrades, 34 Esperance Road has been refreshed with style and comfort in mind. New double-glazed windows, a modern kitchen and bathrooms, fresh carpet and lighting, premium vertical pine cladding, and a heavy-gauge Coloursteel roof combine to create a home that feels distinctive, inviting, and ready for its next chapter.\r\n\r\nWith three bedrooms, two bathrooms and approximately 193sqm of floor area, there's room to spread out and enjoy. Whether you're raising a family, entertaining friends, or looking for the perfect lock-up-and-leave bolthole between overseas adventures, this home offers versatility to match your lifestyle.\r\n\r\nAnd then there's the oversized double garage almost triple in scale offering exciting possibilities. Think a work-from-home studio, golf simulator, games room, extra living space for the kids, or simply an abundance of storage.\r\n\r\nSet on a freehold 234sqm section in one of Glendowie's desirable streets, you're well placed to enjoy the relaxed lifestyle, beaches, parks and family-friendly appeal of Auckland's eastern bays.\r\n\r\nFreshly upgraded, full of possibilities, and with a Florida-inspired feel, 34 Esperance Road is anything but ordinary.\r\n\r\nIt's more than a home it's a chance to secure a distinctive property in a location that continues to capture the hearts of families and lifestyle buyers alike.\r\n\r\nCome and discover a home that's ready to enjoy, with room to make it your own.",
